1
00:00:00,268 --> 00:00:02,718
(Raj:)How are you gonna get
James Earl Jones?

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:06,220
(Sheldon:)Simple. Earlier today, he Tweeted
that he's looking forward

3
00:00:06,374 --> 00:00:08,944
(Sheldon:)to going to his favourite
sushi restaurant for dinner.

4
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,490
(Sheldon:)I Googled an interview
from four years ago

5
00:00:11,646 --> 00:00:14,816
(Sheldon:)which was conducted in
his favourite sushi restaurant.

6
00:00:14,983 --> 00:00:18,363
(Sheldon:)That's where he'll be,
and that's where I'm going, and--

7
00:00:18,519 --> 00:00:21,229
(Howard:)And that's where Darth Vader's gonna
pour soy sauce on your head.

8
00:00:23,558 --> 00:00:25,898
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I don't care if you get
scalped tickets with us or not,

9
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,900
(Leonard:)but please don't be creepy
and go stalking this poor guy.

10
00:00:29,063 --> 00:00:30,663
(Leonard:)You're gonna get in trouble.

11
00:00:30,832 --> 00:00:32,812
(Sheldon:)You're the ones
who are going to get in trouble.

12
00:00:32,967 --> 00:00:34,967
(Sheldon:)You're buying
non-transferable tickets.

13
00:00:35,136 --> 00:00:37,246
(Sheldon:)And from a stranger, no less.

14
00:00:37,405 --> 00:00:39,405
(Sheldon:)Not only can you get
banned from Comic-Con,

15
00:00:39,574 --> 00:00:42,314
(Sheldon:)if caught, you could be charged
with petty theft.

16
00:00:42,477 --> 00:00:45,017
(Sheldon:)You think about that while
I'm warning James Earl Jones

17
00:00:45,179 --> 00:00:47,659
(Sheldon:)about the danger of posting
his location on Twitter.

18
00:00:48,916 --> 00:01:06,026
(Sheldon:)He got lucky this time.
There are some weirdos out there.

